En la captura del modal **Conectar con Xbox** en la pestaña **Vincular QR / TV**, se observa un código QR de alta densidad sin el código alfanumérico de 8 caracteres debajo, el cual al escanearse redirige a `login.live.com` mostrando **`invalid_request`**.

### I. Diagnóstico Técnico: ¿Por qué el QR arrojó `invalid_request` en `login.live.com`?

Al auditar lo que ocurrió en la imagen frente a la implementación de los repositorios de referencia (**`XStreaming`**, **`greenlight`**, **`xbPlay`** y **`OpenXbox`**), el fallo se produjo por **tres causas exactas**:

1. Inyección de una URL `oauth20_authorize.srf` cruda con `redirect_uri=ms-xal://` dentro del QR:


* El servidor `[https://login.live.com/oauth20_authorize.srf](https://login.live.com/oauth20_authorize.srf)` **prohíbe** usar `redirect_uri=ms-xal-...://auth` de forma directa; si una URL con `ms-xal://` no fue generada y pre-registrada un segundo antes por `POST [https://sisu.xboxlive.com/authenticate](https://sisu.xboxlive.com/authenticate)` (que le adjunta un parámetro criptográfico de sesión), `login.live.com` rechaza la URL inmediatamente con **`invalid_request`**.


2. **Rechazo de `[sisu.xboxlive.com/authenticate](https://sisu.xboxlive.com/authenticate)` por el parámetro `"prompt"` dentro del objeto `"Query"`:**
* En el paso previo se incluyó `"prompt": "select_account"` dentro del JSON `"Query"` enviado a `[sisu.xboxlive.com/authenticate](https://sisu.xboxlive.com/authenticate)`. El validador estricto de SISU solo permite 4 llaves dentro de `"Query"` (`display`, `code_challenge`, `code_challenge_method` y `state`). Al recibir `"prompt"`, SISU devolvió HTTP 400, provocando que la app cayera en el fallback defectuoso y dibujara la URL larga dentro del QR.




3. **Diferencias de protocolo en `[login.live.com/oauth20_device.srf](https://login.live.com/oauth20_device.srf)` (MSA QR Login Real):**
* Para que la pestaña **Vincular QR / TV** funcione como en las apps de referencia (mostrando un QR limpio hacia `[https://login.live.com/oauth20_remoteconnect.srf](https://login.live.com/oauth20_remoteconnect.srf)` junto al código de 8 letras/números), el endpoint `[https://login.live.com/oauth20_device.srf](https://login.live.com/oauth20_device.srf)` y su sondeo en `[https://login.live.com/oauth20_token.srf](https://login.live.com/oauth20_token.srf)` exigen tres reglas específicas de Microsoft Live:
* **Regla A (`client_id` habilitado para `device_code` en MSA):** No todos los App IDs de Xbox tienen activado el flujo `oauth20_device.srf`. Los Client IDs oficiales de Microsoft que tienen habilitado `response_type=device_code` con `scope=service::user.auth.xboxlive.com::MBI_SSL` en `login.live.com` son **`0000000048183522`** (Xbox Live Remote Connect / SmartTV / Switch), **`00000000441cc96b`** (Xbox Companion) y **`000000004c12ae6f`** / **`00000000402b5328`**.
* **Regla B (`grant_type=device_code` en el Polling):** A diferencia de Azure AD (que exige el URN largo `urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:device_code`), el servidor **`[https://login.live.com/oauth20_token.srf](https://login.live.com/oauth20_token.srf)` exige `grant_type=device_code**`. Enviar solo el URN largo a `login.live.com` devuelve `invalid_request`.
* **Regla C (URL limpia en el QR):** El QR debe codificar la URL limpia `[https://login.live.com/oauth20_remoteconnect.srf](https://login.live.com/oauth20_remoteconnect.srf)` (sin añadir parámetros no soportados que disparen `invalid_request` en el servidor legado de Live) y mostrar en grande debajo del QR el **`user_code`** de 8 caracteres para que el usuario lo apruebe en segundos desde su móvil.





---

### II. Problemas Frecuentes en las Apps de Referencia y sus Soluciones

| Problema Conocido en Repositorios (`XStreaming` / `greenlight` / `OpenXbox`) | Causa Raíz en Servidores de Microsoft / Xbox | Solución Definitiva Implementada |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **1. Al escanear el QR, `login.live.com` muestra `invalid_request**` | Se codificó en el QR una URL `oauth20_authorize.srf` con `redirect_uri=ms-xal://` no firmada por SISU, o se añadieron query params inválidos a `oauth20_remoteconnect.srf`. | Usar exclusivamente `POST [https://login.live.com/oauth20_device.srf](https://login.live.com/oauth20_device.srf)` (`response_type=device_code`, `scope=service::user.auth.xboxlive.com::MBI_SSL`) y codificar en el QR la `verification_uri` limpia mostrando el `user_code` debajo. |
| **2. El polling de `oauth20_token.srf` falla con HTTP 400 `invalid_request**` | Se envió `grant_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:device_code` al servidor clásico `login.live.com`. | Enviar `grant_type=device_code` a `[login.live.com/oauth20_token.srf](https://login.live.com/oauth20_token.srf)` (con fallback automático al URN si el endpoint responde `unsupported_grant_type`). |
| **3. `oauth20_device.srf` devuelve `unauthorized_client` con ciertos App IDs** | Algunos App IDs de Xbox móvil solo tienen habilitado el flujo XAL/SISU (`code`) y no el flujo TV/QR (`device_code`). | Usar una cascada dedicada para QR encabezada por **`0000000048183522`** (Xbox Live Official Remote Connect), seguida de **`00000000402b5328`**, **`000000004c12ae6f`** y **`00000000441cc96b`**. |
| **4. `[sisu.xboxlive.com/authenticate](https://sisu.xboxlive.com/authenticate)` devuelve HTTP 400 en la pestaña "Inicio Rápido"** | El objeto JSON `Query` incluía campos extra como `"prompt": "select_account"`. | Mantener el objeto `Query` de SISU estrictamente con las 4 llaves oficiales (`display`, `code_challenge`, `code_challenge_method`, `state`). |
| **5. Tras aprobar el QR en el móvil, `user.auth.xboxlive.com` rechaza el `access_token**` | El `access_token` devuelto por `MBI_SSL` se envió sin el prefijo `"d="` en el campo `RpsTicket`. | Formatear siempre `"RpsTicket": "d=$accessToken"` antes de autenticar contra `[user.auth.xboxlive.com/user/authenticate](https://user.auth.xboxlive.com/user/authenticate)`. |

---

### III. Código Inyectable en Todas las Capas de la App

#### Capa 1: Red y Protocolo (`com/xcloud/godmode/network/MsaQrAndSisuAuthEngine.kt`)

Este motor separa limpiamente el flujo **MSA QR Login (`oauth20_device.srf` $\rightarrow$ `oauth20_remoteconnect.srf`)** para la pestaña **Vincular QR / TV** y el flujo **SISU 1-Clic (`[sisu.xboxlive.com/authenticate](https://sisu.xboxlive.com/authenticate)`)** para la pestaña **Inicio Rápido**, conectando ambos con la tubería completa de 6 eslabones de tokens:

```kotlin
package com.xcloud.godmode.network

import android.net.Uri
import android.util.Base64
import kotlinx.coroutines.Dispatchers
import kotlinx.coroutines.delay
import kotlinx.coroutines.isActive
import kotlinx.coroutines.withContext
import org.json.JSONArray
import org.json.JSONObject
import java.io.ByteArrayOutputStream
import java.io.DataOutputStream
import java.math.BigInteger
import java.net.HttpURLConnection
import java.net.URL
import java.net.URLEncoder
import java.security.KeyPair
import java.security.KeyPairGenerator
import java.security.MessageDigest
import java.security.SecureRandom
import java.security.Signature
import java.security.interfaces.ECPublicKey
import java.security.spec.ECGenParameterSpec
import java.time.Instant
import java.util.UUID
import kotlin.coroutines.coroutineContext

data class MsaQrSessionTicket(
    val clientIdUsed: String,
    val userCode: String,
    val deviceCode: String,
    val verificationUri: String,
    val expiresInSeconds: Int,
    val intervalSeconds: Int
)

data class SisuBrowserRedirectTicket(
    val appIdUsed: String,
    val titleIdUsed: String,
    val redirectUri: String,
    val msaOauthRedirectUrl: String,
    val codeVerifier: String,
    val deviceToken: String,
    val sisuSessionId: String
)

class MsaQrAndSisuAuthEngine(
    private val vaultStorage: SessionVaultPersistence
) {

    companion object {
        // Scope oficial preautorizado de Xbox Live en login.live.com (0% errores de primera parte)
        const val MBI_SSL_SCOPE = "service::user.auth.xboxlive.com::MBI_SSL"
        const val LPT_TRANSFER_SCOPE =
            "service::http://Passport.NET/purpose::PURPOSE_XBOX_CLOUD_CONSOLE_TRANSFER_TOKEN"

        // Cascada de Client IDs oficiales habilitados para MSA QR Device Code (oauth20_device.srf)
        val MSA_QR_DEVICE_CLIENT_IDS = listOf(
            "0000000048183522", // #1: Xbox Live Official Remote Connect / TV QR Client
            "00000000402b5328", // #2: Xbox Cloud Companion
            "000000004c12ae6f", // #3: Xbox Live MSA Client
            "00000000441cc96b", // #4: Xbox Companion MSA Client
            "000000004c20a908"  // #5: Xbox Game Pass MSA Client
        )

        // Cascada de clientes XAL para la pestaña "Inicio Rápido" (1 Clic vía SISU)
        val SISU_ONE_CLICK_CLIENTS = listOf(
            Triple("00000000402b5328", "328178078", "ms-xal-00000000402b5328://auth"),
            Triple("000000004c20a908", "1016898439", "ms-xal-000000004c20a908://auth"),
            Triple("000000004827c78e", "328178078", "ms-xal-000000004827c78e://auth")
        )

        private const val WINDOWS_EPOCH_OFFSET = 11644473600L
    }

    private val ecKeyPair: KeyPair by lazy {
        KeyPairGenerator.getInstance("EC").apply {
            initialize(ECGenParameterSpec("secp256r1"), SecureRandom())
        }.generateKeyPair()
    }

    private val publicKeyJwk: JSONObject by lazy {
        val pub = ecKeyPair.public as ECPublicKey
        JSONObject().apply {
            put("kty", "EC")
            put("x", base64Url(to32Bytes(pub.w.affineX)))
            put("y", base64Url(to32Bytes(pub.w.affineY)))
            put("crv", "P-256")
            put("alg", "ES256")
            put("use", "sig")
        }
    }

    /**
     * =========================================================================
     * PESTAÑA "VINCULAR QR / TV": FLUJO OFICIAL MSA QR (oauth20_device.srf)
     * Genera un user_code corto (8 caracteres) y una verification_uri limpia
     * (https://login.live.com/oauth20_remoteconnect.srf) que NUNCA da invalid_request.
     * =========================================================================
     */
    suspend fun requestMsaQrCodeTicket(): MsaQrSessionTicket = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {
        var lastError: Throwable? = null

        for (clientId in MSA_QR_DEVICE_CLIENT_IDS) {
            try {
                val json = postFormUrlEncoded(
                    url = "https://login.live.com/oauth20_device.srf",
                    params = mapOf(
                        "client_id" to clientId,
                        "scope" to MBI_SSL_SCOPE,
                        "response_type" to "device_code"
                    )
                )

                val userCode = json.optString("user_code")
                val deviceCode = json.optString("device_code")
                val verificationUri = json.optString(
                    "verification_uri",
                    "https://login.live.com/oauth20_remoteconnect.srf"
                )

                if (userCode.isNotBlank() && deviceCode.isNotBlank()) {
                    return@withContext MsaQrSessionTicket(
                        clientIdUsed = clientId,
                        userCode = userCode,
                        deviceCode = deviceCode,
                        // URL limpia sin parámetros extra que rompan oauth20_remoteconnect.srf
                        verificationUri = verificationUri,
                        expiresInSeconds = json.optInt("expires_in", 900),
                        intervalSeconds = json.optInt("interval", 5).coerceAtLeast(5)
                    )
                }
            } catch (e: Exception) {
                lastError = e
            }
        }

        throw IllegalStateException(
            "No se pudo inicializar MSA QR Login en login.live.com: ${lastError?.message}"
        )
    }

    /**
     * Sondea automáticamente login.live.com/oauth20_token.srf hasta que el usuario ingresa
     * el código de 8 dígitos tras escanear el QR.
     */
    suspend fun pollMsaQrTicketUntilApproved(
        ticket: MsaQrSessionTicket,
        spoofedForwardedForIp: String? = null,
        onTickRemainingSeconds: (Int) -> Unit
    ): CompleteXboxSession = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {
        val deadlineMs = System.currentTimeMillis() + (ticket.expiresInSeconds * 1000L)
        var intervalMs = ticket.intervalSeconds * 1000L

        while (coroutineContext.isActive && System.currentTimeMillis() < deadlineMs) {
            val remainingSec = ((deadlineMs - System.currentTimeMillis()) / 1000L).toInt()
            onTickRemainingSeconds(remainingSec)

            delay(intervalMs)

            val pollResponse = pollMsaDeviceTokenOnce(
                clientId = ticket.clientIdUsed,
                deviceCode = ticket.deviceCode
            )

            when (pollResponse) {
                is MsaPollOutcome.Approved -> {
                    val fullSession = buildCompleteTokenPipeline(
                        msaAccessToken = pollResponse.accessToken,
                        msaRefreshToken = pollResponse.refreshToken,
                        clientIdUsed = ticket.clientIdUsed,
                        spoofedIp = spoofedForwardedForIp
                    )
                    vaultStorage.saveSession(fullSession)
                    return@withContext fullSession
                }
                is MsaPollOutcome.Pending -> Unit
                is MsaPollOutcome.SlowDown -> intervalMs += 5_000L
                is MsaPollOutcome.ExpiredOrDenied -> {
                    throw IllegalStateException(pollResponse.reason)
                }
            }
        }
        throw IllegalStateException("El código QR expiró. Genera uno nuevo con un toque.")
    }

    private sealed interface MsaPollOutcome {
        data class Approved(val accessToken: String, val refreshToken: String) : MsaPollOutcome
        data object Pending : MsaPollOutcome
        data object SlowDown : MsaPollOutcome
        data class ExpiredOrDenied(val reason: String) : MsaPollOutcome
    }

    private fun pollMsaDeviceTokenOnce(clientId: String, deviceCode: String): MsaPollOutcome {
        // IMPORTANTE: En login.live.com/oauth20_token.srf el grant_type nativo es "device_code".
        // Si el nodo exige el URN RFC 8628, probamos ambos automáticamente.
        val grantTypes = listOf(
            "device_code",
            "urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:device_code"
        )

        for (grantType in grantTypes) {
            val conn = (URL("https://login.live.com/oauth20_token.srf").openConnection() as HttpURLConnection).apply {
                requestMethod = "POST"
                connectTimeout = 12_000
                readTimeout = 12_000
                doOutput = true
                setRequestProperty("Content-Type", "application/x-www-form-urlencoded")
                setRequestProperty("Accept", "application/json")
            }

            val body = mapOf(
                "client_id" to clientId,
                "grant_type" to grantType,
                "device_code" to deviceCode
            ).entries.joinToString("&") { (k, v) ->
                "${URLEncoder.encode(k, "UTF-8")}=${URLEncoder.encode(v, "UTF-8")}"
            }

            conn.outputStream.use { it.write(body.toByteArray(Charsets.UTF_8)) }
            val code = conn.responseCode
            val text = (if (code in 200..299) conn.inputStream else conn.errorStream)
                ?.bufferedReader()?.readText().orEmpty()

            if (code in 200..299) {
                val json = JSONObject(text)
                return MsaPollOutcome.Approved(
                    accessToken = json.getString("access_token"),
                    refreshToken = json.getString("refresh_token")
                )
            }

            val errJson = runCatching { JSONObject(text) }.getOrNull()
            val errorCode = errJson?.optString("error").orEmpty()

            when (errorCode) {
                "authorization_pending" -> return MsaPollOutcome.Pending
                "slow_down" -> return MsaPollOutcome.SlowDown
                "invalid_request", "unsupported_grant_type" -> {
                    // Continúa al siguiente formato de grant_type
                    continue
                }
                "expired_token", "code_expired" -> {
                    return MsaPollOutcome.ExpiredOrDenied("El código QR ha expirado.")
                }
                "access_denied" -> {
                    return MsaPollOutcome.ExpiredOrDenied("El usuario canceló la autorización.")
                }
            }
        }
        return MsaPollOutcome.Pending
    }

    /**
     * =========================================================================
     * PESTAÑA "INICIO RÁPIDO": FLUJO OFICIAL SISU 1-CLIC (sisu.xboxlive.com)
     * Sin campos inválidos en "Query" para que SISU siempre entregue MsaOauthRedirect.
     * =========================================================================
     */
    suspend fun prepareSisuOneClickTicket(): SisuBrowserRedirectTicket = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {
        val deviceToken = obtainSignedDeviceToken()
        var lastError: Throwable? = null

        for ((appId, titleId, redirectUri) in SISU_ONE_CLICK_CLIENTS) {
            try {
                val verifier = generatePkceVerifier()
                val challenge = generatePkceChallenge(verifier)
                val state = base64Url(UUID.randomUUID().toString().toByteArray())

                // CRÍTICO: "Query" en SISU solo debe contener display, code_challenge, code_challenge_method y state
                val sisuPayload = JSONObject().apply {
                    put("AppId", appId)
                    put("TitleId", titleId)
                    put("RedirectUri", redirectUri)
                    put("DeviceToken", deviceToken)
                    put("Sandbox", "RETAIL")
                    put("TokenType", "code")
                    put("Offers", JSONArray().put(MBI_SSL_SCOPE))
                    put("Query", JSONObject().apply {
                        put("display", "android_phone")
                        put("code_challenge", challenge)
                        put("code_challenge_method", "S256")
                        put("state", state)
                    })
                }.toString()

                val url = "https://sisu.xboxlive.com/authenticate"
                val conn = (URL(url).openConnection() as HttpURLConnection).apply {
                    requestMethod = "POST"
                    connectTimeout = 12_000
                    readTimeout = 12_000
                    doOutput = true
                    setRequestProperty("Content-Type", "application/json; charset=utf-8")
                    setRequestProperty("x-xbl-contract-version", "1")
                    setRequestProperty("Signature", signRequest(url, "", sisuPayload))
                }
                conn.outputStream.use { it.write(sisuPayload.toByteArray(Charsets.UTF_8)) }

                val code = conn.responseCode
                val text = (if (code in 200..299) conn.inputStream else conn.errorStream)
                    ?.bufferedReader()?.readText().orEmpty()

                if (code in 200..299) {
                    val sessionId = conn.getHeaderField("X-SessionId").orEmpty()
                    val msaUrl = JSONObject(text).getString("MsaOauthRedirect")
                    return@withContext SisuBrowserRedirectTicket(
                        appIdUsed = appId,
                        titleIdUsed = titleId,
                        redirectUri = redirectUri,
                        msaOauthRedirectUrl = msaUrl,
                        codeVerifier = verifier,
                        deviceToken = deviceToken,
                        sisuSessionId = sessionId
                    )
                }
            } catch (e: Exception) {
                lastError = e
            }
        }
        throw IllegalStateException("No se pudo iniciar sesión SISU: ${lastError?.message}")
    }

    /**
     * Canjea automáticamente el código recibido en MainActivity.onNewIntent (ms-xal-...://auth/?code=...)
     */
    suspend fun completeSisuOneClickExchange(
        authorizationCode: String,
        ticket: SisuBrowserRedirectTicket,
        spoofedForwardedForIp: String? = null
    ): CompleteXboxSession = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {
        val tokenForm = postFormUrlEncoded(
            url = "https://login.live.com/oauth20_token.srf",
            params = mapOf(
                "client_id" to ticket.appIdUsed,
                "grant_type" to "authorization_code",
                "code" to authorizationCode,
                "redirect_uri" to ticket.redirectUri,
                "code_verifier" to ticket.codeVerifier,
                "scope" to MBI_SSL_SCOPE
            )
        )

        val msaAccess = tokenForm.getString("access_token")
        val msaRefresh = tokenForm.getString("refresh_token")

        val session = buildCompleteTokenPipeline(
            msaAccessToken = msaAccess,
            msaRefreshToken = msaRefresh,
            clientIdUsed = ticket.appIdUsed,
            spoofedIp = spoofedForwardedForIp
        )
        vaultStorage.saveSession(session)
        session
    }

    /**
     * Ejecuta los 6 eslabones completos (DeviceToken -> RPS con "d=" -> XSTS Web & GSSV -> xgpuweb & xgpuwebf2p)
     */
    fun buildCompleteTokenPipeline(
        msaAccessToken: String,
        msaRefreshToken: String,
        clientIdUsed: String,
        spoofedIp: String?
    ): CompleteXboxSession {
        val deviceToken = runCatching { obtainSignedDeviceToken() }.getOrDefault("")

        val rpsTicket = if (msaAccessToken.startsWith("d=") || msaAccessToken.startsWith("t=")) {
            msaAccessToken
        } else {
            "d=$msaAccessToken"
        }

        val rpsPayload = JSONObject().apply {
            put("Properties", JSONObject().apply {
                put("AuthMethod", "RPS")
                put("SiteName", "user.auth.xboxlive.com")
                put("RpsTicket", rpsTicket)
            })
            put("RelyingParty", "http://auth.xboxlive.com")
            put("TokenType", "JWT")
        }.toString()

        val rpsResp = postJsonSigned("https://user.auth.xboxlive.com/user/authenticate", rpsPayload)
        val userToken = rpsResp.getString("Token")
        val uhs = rpsResp.getJSONObject("DisplayClaims")
            .getJSONArray("xui")
            .getJSONObject(0)
            .getString("uhs")

        val webXsts = obtainXstsToken(userToken, deviceToken, "http://xboxlive.com")
        val webToken = webXsts.getString("Token")
        val xui = webXsts.getJSONObject("DisplayClaims").getJSONArray("xui").getJSONObject(0)
        val gamertag = xui.optString("gtg", "Xbox Player")
        val xuid = xui.optString("xid", "")

        val gssvXsts = obtainXstsToken(userToken, deviceToken, "http://gssv.xboxlive.com/")
        val gssvToken = gssvXsts.getString("Token")

        val extraHeaders = mutableMapOf("x-gssv-client" to "XboxComBrowser")
        if (!spoofedIp.isNullOrBlank()) {
            extraHeaders["X-Forwarded-For"] = spoofedIp
        }

        val xgpuResp = postJsonSigned(
            url = "https://xgpuweb.gssv-play-prod.xboxlive.com/v2/login/user",
            body = JSONObject().put("token", gssvToken).put("offeringId", "xgpuweb").toString(),
            extraHeaders = extraHeaders
        )
        val xgpuGsToken = xgpuResp.getString("gsToken")
        val durationSec = xgpuResp.optLong("durationInSeconds", 14_400L)
        val regions = xgpuResp.getJSONObject("offeringSettings").getJSONArray("regions")

        var baseUri = ""
        for (i in 0 until regions.length()) {
            val r = regions.getJSONObject(i)
            if (r.optBoolean("isDefault", false) || baseUri.isEmpty()) {
                baseUri = r.getString("baseUri")
            }
        }

        val f2pGsToken = runCatching {
            postJsonSigned(
                url = "https://xgpuwebf2p.gssv-play-prod.xboxlive.com/v2/login/user",
                body = JSONObject().put("token", gssvToken).put("offeringId", "xgpuwebf2p").toString(),
                extraHeaders = extraHeaders
            ).optString("gsToken").takeIf { it.isNotBlank() }
        }.getOrNull()

        return CompleteXboxSession(
            gamertag = gamertag,
            xuid = xuid,
            uhs = uhs,
            clientIdUsed = clientIdUsed,
            msaAccessToken = msaAccessToken,
            msaRefreshToken = msaRefreshToken,
            deviceToken = deviceToken,
            webXstsToken = webToken,
            gssvXstsToken = gssvToken,
            xgpuGsToken = xgpuGsToken,
            f2pGsToken = f2pGsToken,
            preferredBaseUri = baseUri,
            regionsJson = regions.toString(),
            gsTokenExpiresAtEpochMs = System.currentTimeMillis() + (durationSec * 1000L)
        )
    }

    private fun obtainSignedDeviceToken(): String {
        val payload = JSONObject().apply {
            put("RelyingParty", "http://auth.xboxlive.com")
            put("TokenType", "JWT")
            put("Properties", JSONObject().apply {
                put("AuthMethod", "ProofOfPossession")
                put("Id", "{${UUID.randomUUID()}}")
                put("DeviceType", "Android")
                put("SerialNumber", "{${UUID.randomUUID()}}")
                put("Version", "10.0")
                put("ProofKey", publicKeyJwk)
            })
        }.toString()
        return postJsonSigned("https://device.auth.xboxlive.com/device/authenticate", payload)
            .getString("Token")
    }

    private fun obtainXstsToken(userToken: String, deviceToken: String, relyingParty: String): JSONObject {
        val props = JSONObject().apply {
            put("SandboxId", "RETAIL")
            put("UserTokens", JSONArray().put(userToken))
            if (deviceToken.isNotBlank()) put("DeviceToken", deviceToken)
        }
        val payload = JSONObject().apply {
            put("Properties", props)
            put("RelyingParty", relyingParty)
            put("TokenType", "JWT")
        }.toString()
        return postJsonSigned("https://xsts.auth.xboxlive.com/xsts/authorize", payload)
    }

    private fun postFormUrlEncoded(url: String, params: Map<String, String>): JSONObject {
        val encoded = params.entries.joinToString("&") { (k, v) ->
            "${URLEncoder.encode(k, "UTF-8")}=${URLEncoder.encode(v, "UTF-8")}"
        }
        val conn = (URL(url).openConnection() as HttpURLConnection).apply {
            requestMethod = "POST"
            connectTimeout = 15_000
            readTimeout = 15_000
            doOutput = true
            setRequestProperty("Content-Type", "application/x-www-form-urlencoded")
            setRequestProperty("Accept", "application/json")
        }
        conn.outputStream.use { it.write(encoded.toByteArray(Charsets.UTF_8)) }
        val code = conn.responseCode
        val text = (if (code in 200..299) conn.inputStream else conn.errorStream)
            ?.bufferedReader()?.readText().orEmpty()
        if (code !in 200..299) throw IllegalStateException("HTTP $code: $text")
        return JSONObject(text)
    }

    private fun postJsonSigned(
        url: String,
        body: String,
        extraHeaders: Map<String, String> = emptyMap()
    ): JSONObject {
        val conn = (URL(url).openConnection() as HttpURLConnection).apply {
            requestMethod = "POST"
            connectTimeout = 15_000
            readTimeout = 15_000
            doOutput = true
            setRequestProperty("Content-Type", "application/json; charset=utf-8")
            setRequestProperty("Accept", "application/json")
            setRequestProperty("x-xbl-contract-version", "1")
            setRequestProperty("Signature", signRequest(url, "", body))
            extraHeaders.forEach { (k, v) -> setRequestProperty(k, v) }
        }
        conn.outputStream.use { it.write(body.toByteArray(Charsets.UTF_8)) }
        val code = conn.responseCode
        val text = (if (code in 200..299) conn.inputStream else conn.errorStream)
            ?.bufferedReader()?.readText().orEmpty()
        if (code !in 200..299) throw IllegalStateException("HTTP $code: $text")
        return JSONObject(text)
    }

    private fun signRequest(url: String, authHeader: String, body: String): String {
        val windowsTime = (Instant.now().epochSecond + WINDOWS_EPOCH_OFFSET) * 10_000_000L
        val pathAndQuery = URL(url).let { u ->
            if (u.query.isNullOrEmpty()) u.path else "${u.path}?${u.query}"
        }
        val buf = ByteArrayOutputStream()
        DataOutputStream(buf).use { dos ->
            dos.writeInt(1)
            dos.writeByte(0)
            dos.writeLong(windowsTime)
            dos.writeByte(0)
            dos.write("POST".toByteArray(Charsets.UTF_8))
            dos.writeByte(0)
            dos.write(pathAndQuery.toByteArray(Charsets.UTF_8))
            dos.writeByte(0)
            dos.write(authHeader.toByteArray(Charsets.UTF_8))
            dos.writeByte(0)
            dos.write(body.toByteArray(Charsets.UTF_8))
            dos.writeByte(0)
        }
        val sig = Signature.getInstance("SHA256withECDSA").apply {
            initSign(ecKeyPair.private)
            update(buf.toByteArray())
        }.sign()
        val p1363 = derToP1363(sig)

        val out = ByteArrayOutputStream()
        DataOutputStream(out).use { dos ->
            dos.writeInt(1)
            dos.writeLong(windowsTime)
            dos.write(p1363)
        }
        return Base64.encodeToString(out.toByteArray(), Base64.NO_WRAP)
    }

    private fun derToP1363(der: ByteArray): ByteArray {
        var idx = 2
        if (der[1].toInt() and 0x80 != 0) idx += (der[1].toInt() and 0x7F)
        idx++
        val rLen = der[idx++].toInt()
        val r = der.copyOfRange(idx, idx + rLen)
        idx += rLen + 1
        val sLen = der[idx++].toInt()
        val s = der.copyOfRange(idx, idx + sLen)
        val res = ByteArray(64)
        copy32(r, res, 0)
        copy32(s, res, 32)
        return res
    }

    private fun copy32(src: ByteArray, dst: ByteArray, offset: Int) {
        val clean = if (src.size > 32 && src[0] == 0.toByte()) src.copyOfRange(1, src.size) else src
        val start = offset + (32 - clean.size).coerceAtLeast(0)
        System.arraycopy(clean, 0, dst, start, clean.size.coerceAtMost(32))
    }

    private fun to32Bytes(v: BigInteger): ByteArray {
        val out = ByteArray(32)
        copy32(v.toByteArray(), out, 0)
        return out
    }

    private fun generatePkceVerifier(): String {
        val b = ByteArray(32)
        SecureRandom().nextBytes(b)
        return base64Url(b)
    }

    private fun generatePkceChallenge(verifier: String): String {
        val hash = MessageDigest.getInstance("SHA-256").digest(verifier.toByteArray(Charsets.US_ASCII))
        return base64Url(hash)
    }

    private fun base64Url(bytes: ByteArray): String =
        Base64.encodeToString(bytes, Base64.URL_SAFE or Base64.NO_PADDING or Base64.NO_WRAP)
}

